{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 63,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.17418670654297,
        145.14486694335938,
        83.2621841430664
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.96521759033203,
        526.9829711914062,
        107.11021423339844
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability of the test seems to be slightly reduced because TB LAMP cannot test for rifampicin",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        109.46521759033203,
        312.4341735839844,
        122.61021423339844
      ],
      "text": "resistance and has no multiplexing opportunities.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        134.41680908203125,
        128.31727600097656,
        148.5048065185547
      ],
      "text": "Feasibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.20782470703125,
        526.9658203125,
        172.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "Summarized findings from the interview study on TB LAMP are as follows. TB LAMP improves",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        174.70782470703125,
        526.9150390625,
        187.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "access to TB diagnosis for people who would otherwise have been missed, because it can run",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        190.20782470703125,
        526.7278442382812,
        203.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "in laboratories with limited infrastructure, has high throughput, is more accurate than SSM and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970259666442871,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.70782470703125,
        526.9368896484375,
        218.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "reduces workload at GeneXpert sites. It allows decentralization of testing and therefore has",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.20782470703125,
        526.9921875,
        234.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "the potential to reduce catastrophic cost to patients. However, TB LAMP adoption decisions",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        236.70782470703125,
        349.1739807128906,
        249.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "are also driven by donors and investment considerations.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.71173095703125,
        527.1738891601562,
        273.85675048828125
      ],
      "text": "Overall, TB LAMP allows staff to carry out more tests, and faster. Its high throughput contributes",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.958672523498535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.21173095703125,
        526.9622802734375,
        289.35675048828125
      ],
      "text": "to acceptability and utilization. Laboratory staff in Nigeria are given incentives for the number",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.71173095703125,
        526.9920654296875,
        304.85675048828125
      ],
      "text": "of tests they carry out, making use of TB LAMP even more attractive. These incentives also",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.21173095703125,
        433.354248046875,
        320.35675048828125
      ],
      "text": "support swift action when maintenance or repair of the devices is needed.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.2156066894531,
        526.9262084960938,
        344.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "Programmatic feasibility seems to be less of a concern than with GeneXpert. Compared with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.7156066894531,
        526.9645385742188,
        359.8606262207031
      ],
      "text": "implementing GeneXpert, programme officers find TB LAMP more feasible to implement due",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.2156066894531,
        527.036865234375,
        375.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "to its lower requirements for infrastructure, skills level and maintenance. As with all LC-NAATs,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991395950317383,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        377.7156066894531,
        526.8358764648438,
        390.8606262207031
      ],
      "text": "staffing and reagent supply issues challenge its use. TB LAMP’s impact on the overall turnaround",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946067810058594,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.2156066894531,
        526.9371948242188,
        406.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "time for DR-TB diagnosis, MDR-TB treatment initiation and loss to follow-up at sites without",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.7156066894531,
        527.2021484375,
        421.8606262207031
      ],
      "text": "Xpert Ultra testing depends on the efficiency and robustness of the sample transport or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.2156066894531,
        145.577392578125,
        437.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "referral system.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        448.2196044921875,
        517.9655151367188,
        461.3646240234375
      ],
      "text": "More details on the qualitative evaluation of LC-mNAATs are available in  Web Annex B.10.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.73114013671875,
        275.1541442871094,
        490.1111145019531
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.36212158203125,
        78.81909942626953,
        513.5071411132812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        500.36212158203125,
        526.9644165039062,
        513.5071411132812
      ],
      "text": "Diagnostic products in the low-complexity classes of tests should be prequalified by WHO",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        515.8621215820312,
        342.7539978027344,
        529.0071411132812
      ],
      "text": "or approved by another regulator before clinical use.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.3621215820312,
        78.81909942626953,
        544.5071411132812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        531.3621215820312,
        527.0965576171875,
        544.5071411132812
      ],
      "text": "Diagnostic test manufacturers, laboratory and programme managers, and policy-makers",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        546.8621215820312,
        361.1793212890625,
        560.0071411132812
      ],
      "text": "should be educated on the WHO PQ process for TB IVDs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.3621215820312,
        78.81909942626953,
        575.5071411132812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        562.3621215820312,
        512.767578125,
        575.5071411132812
      ],
      "text": "Ensuring sufficient volume and specimen quality is important to obtain accurate results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.8621215820312,
        78.81909942626953,
        591.0071411132812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        577.8621215820312,
        526.9093627929688,
        591.0071411132812
      ],
      "text": "Safe waste disposal of used test consumables needs to be planned in advance to minimize",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        593.3621215820312,
        178.802001953125,
        606.5071411132812
      ],
      "text": "environmental risk.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.7083129882812,
        246.56613159179688,
        638.0883178710938
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.3392333984375,
        78.81909942626953,
        661.4842529296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        648.3392333984375,
        527.0306396484375,
        661.4842529296875
      ],
      "text": "Track errors and invalid test result rates for currently recommended products and new",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        663.8392333984375,
        272.96044921875,
        676.9842529296875
      ],
      "text": "products to be introduced in this class.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.3392333984375,
        78.81909942626953,
        692.4842529296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        679.3392333984375,
        524.412353515625,
        692.4842529296875
      ],
      "text": "Monitor the proportion of people with bacteriologically confirmed TB without rifampicin-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        694.8392333984375,
        369.8243713378906,
        707.9842529296875
      ],
      "text": "resistance reflex testing or access to further DST over time.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        554.5132446289062,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 47",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}